# Debug credentials for API testing (git-ignored, local only)
# Format: KEY=VALUE, one per line, # for comments.
# AI assistants: cat this file (or source it) to read TOKEN/API_KEY.
# DO NOT commit this file. The .gitignore entry excludes it.

# ============== Bearer Token (browser-style, 30-day expiry, device-bound) ==============
# Get a fresh token:
#   TOKEN=$(curl -s -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login \
#     -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
#     -d '{"password":"YOUR_PASSWORD","fingerprint":"fp-debug"}' \
#     | python3 -c "import sys,json;print(json.load(sys.stdin)['data']['token'])")
# Then append below:
TOKEN=

# ============== API Key (script/curl style, doesn't expire) ==============
# Get a fresh API key in web UI: Settings page → 🎨 生图模型 → + 添加生图提供商 → 生成 API Key.
# Then append below:
API_KEY=

# ============== Usage examples ==============
# Curl with Bearer Token:
#   curl -s http://localhost:8080/api/events?date=today \
#     -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" \
#     -H "X-Device-Fingerprint: fp-debug"
#
# Curl with API Key:
#   curl -s http://localhost:8080/api/events?date=today \
#     -H "X-API-Key: $API_KEY"
#
# Source this file in shell scripts:
#   . backend/data/.debug_credentials && curl -H "X-API-Key: $API_KEY" ...